### PayVerse — wallet-service through the gateway. Run 01-auth.http steps 1–2 (sets {{accessToken}}),
### set a PIN (01-auth.http step 5) and do min KYC (02-user.http) first: NONE-tier wallets can't move money.

### My wallet: balance, status, KYC tier, limits and usage
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Add money (MOCK gateway; amounts ending in .13 are declined). Re-send with the same key → same response.
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/wallets/me/add-money
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 6c3a0d0e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 2500.50, "paymentMethod": "UPI" }

### Add money that the MOCK gateway declines → 402 WALLET_PAYMENT_DECLINED
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/wallets/me/add-money
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.13, "paymentMethod": "CARD" }

### Withdraw to a linked bank account (needs the transaction PIN; bankAccountId from 02-user.http)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/wallets/me/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 500.00, "bankAccountId": "{{bankAccountId}}" }

### Ledger history (newest first, with running balance)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/wallets/me/ledger?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### --- Internal saga API on wallet-service (port 8083, role SERVICE) — get {{serviceToken}} from 01-auth.http ---

### Debit (TRANSFER → TRANSFER_SUSPENSE)
POST {{wallet}}/internal/wallets/{{userId}}/debit
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Idempotency-Key: txn-0001:debit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "purpose": "TRANSFER", "referenceType": "Transaction", "referenceId": "txn-0001" }

### Credit (TRANSFER ← TRANSFER_SUSPENSE)
POST {{wallet}}/internal/wallets/{{payeeUserId}}/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Idempotency-Key: txn-0001:credit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "purpose": "TRANSFER", "referenceType": "Transaction", "referenceId": "txn-0001" }

### Reverse a journal (saga compensation)
POST {{wallet}}/internal/wallets/{{userId}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Idempotency-Key: txn-0001:compensate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "journalId": "{{journalId}}", "reason": "credit failed" }

### Freeze / unfreeze
POST {{wallet}}/internal/wallets/{{userId}}/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "fraud review" }

###
POST {{wallet}}/internal/wallets/{{userId}}/unfreeze
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### Ledger integrity report
GET {{wallet}}/internal/wallets/integrity
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
